    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/yaGutDhlfMHwRcVI60RxB30Fbpkazv3qZFyuFlXBNpU.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{L}=25 \\mathrm{~m}, \\mathrm{~A}=5 \\mathrm{~mm}^2=5 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{~m}^2 \\\\\n& \\rho=2 \\times 10^{-6} \\Omega \\mathrm{~m} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{R}_{\\text {wire }}=\\frac{\\rho \\mathrm{L}}{\\mathrm{~A}}=\\frac{2 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 25}{5 \\times 10^{-6}}=10 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{eq}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{R}}{4}=\\frac{10}{4}=2.5 \\Omega<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>Answer does not match with NTA option.",
